# SPA fallback for static hosts that honor _redirects (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify,
# IPFS subdomain gateways). BrowserRouter uses real paths (/entity, /search);
# without this, a direct load or refresh of those 404s. The CDN snapshot and hashed
# assets are real files and are served as-is — only unknown paths fall through to
# index.html (200, not a redirect).
/cdn/*  /cdn/:splat  200
/*      /index.html  200
